{"title":"Material Properties (official JSON Manual)","input_uri":"/db/MATL","methods":["POST","GET","PUT","DELETE"],"evidence":"shared","product_hint":"NX series official JSON Manual","official_url":"https://support.midasuser.com/hc/en-us/articles/35807411331993-Material-Properties","edited":"2025-11-04","notes":"Official page also contains 'MIDAS CIVIL NX only' and/or 'MIDAS GEN NX only' markers. The converted public page did not bind those footnotes to specific rows, so this catalog does not invent which fields are product-exclusive. Confirm on the live official page. /db/MATL-M1 is Hyper-S only and is not included as a default capability.","fields":[{"key":"TYPE","name":"Material Type","type":"String","required":"Required","enums":["CONC","STEEL","SRC","ALUMINUM","User"]},{"key":"NAME","name":"Material Name","type":"String","required":"Required"},{"key":"HE_SPEC","name":"Specific heat","type":"Number","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"HE_COND","name":"Heat Conduction","type":"Number","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"PLMT","name":"Plastic Material No.","type":"Integer","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"P_NAME","name":"Plastic Material Name","type":"String","required":"Optional","default":"Blank"},{"key":"bMASS_DENS","name":"Use Mass Density","type":"Boolean","required":"Optional","default":"false"},{"key":"DAMP_RAT","name":"Damping Ratio","type":"Number","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"PARAM","name":"Material Parameter","type":"Array/Object","required":"Required"},{"key":"P_TYPE","name":"PARAM material type","type":"Integer","required":"Required","group":"PARAM","notes":"Standard 1, Isotropic 2, Orthotropic 3"},{"key":"STANDARD","name":"Standard Name","type":"String","required":"Required when P_TYPE=1","group":"PARAM P_TYPE=1"},{"key":"CODE","name":"Code Name","type":"String","required":"Optional","default":"Blank","group":"PARAM P_TYPE=1"},{"key":"DB","name":"DB Name","type":"String","required":"Required when P_TYPE