{"title":"Section Properties - Common (official JSON Manual)","input_uri":"/db/SECT","methods":["POST","GET","PUT","DELETE"],"evidence":"shared","product_hint":"NX series official JSON Manual; other section-shape pages exist under the same URI","official_url":"https://support.midasuser.com/hc/en-us/articles/35808653964185-Section-Properties-Common","edited":"2025-11-04","notes":"Official page also contains 'MIDAS CIVIL NX only' and/or 'MIDAS GEN NX only' markers. The converted public page did not bind those footnotes to specific rows, so this catalog does not invent which fields are product-exclusive. Confirm on the live official page. Official table lists Steel Girder SECTTYPE as \"SOD\". Shape codes are many; see the official page rather than guessing. Additional shape-specific keys are on other official section pages (Value, DB/User, PSC, etc.) and were not all ingested in this revision.","fields":[{"key":"SECTTYPE","name":"Section Data Type","type":"String","required":"Required","enums":["DBUSER","VALUE","SRC","COMBINED","PSC","TAPERED","COMPOSITE","SOD"]},{"key":"SECT_NAME","name":"Section Name","type":"String","required":"Required"},{"key":"SECT_BEFORE","name":"Section Data - Before","type":"Object","required":"Required"},{"key":"SHAPE","name":"Section Shape","type":"String","required":"Required","group":"SECT_BEFORE"},{"key":"OFFSET_PT","name":"Offset Direction","type":"String","required":"Optional","default":"CC","group":"SECT_BEFORE","enums":["LT","CT","RT","LC","CC","RC","LB","CB","RB"]},{"key":"OFFSET_CENTER","name":"Center Location","type":"Integer","required":"Optional","default":"0","notes":"Centroid 0, Center of Section 1"},{"key":"HORZ_OFFSET_OPT","name":"Horizontal Offset Option","type":"Integer","required":"Optional","default":"0","notes":"to Extreme Fiber 0, User 1"},{"key":"USERDEF_OFFSET_YI","name":"Horizontal Offset Value for I","type":"Number","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"USERDEF_OFFSET_YJ","name":"Horizontal Offset Value for J","type":"Number","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"VERT_OFFSET_OPT","name":"Vertical Offset Option","type":"Integer","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"USERDEF_OFFSET_ZI","name":"Vertical Offset Value for I","type":"Number","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"USERDEF_OFFSET_ZJ","name":"Vertical Offset Value for J","type":"Number","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"USER_OFFSET_REF","name":"User Type Offset Reference Position","type":"Integer","required":"Optional","default":"0"},{"key":"USE_SHEAR_DEFORM","name":"Consider Shear Deformation","type":"Boolean","required":"Optional","default":"false"},{"key":"USE_WARPING_EFFECT","name":"Consider Warping Effect","type":"Boolean","required":"Optional","default":"false"}],"examples":[{"label":"Official DBUSER short example","body":{"Assign":{"6001":{"SECTTYPE":"DBUSER","SECT_NAME":"LT_Const","SECT_BEFORE":{"OFFSET_PT":"LT","HORZ_OFFSET_OPT":0,"VERT_OFFSET_OPT":0,"USE_SHEAR_DEFORM":false,"USE_WARPING_EFFECT":false,"SHAPE":"SB","DATATYPE":2,"SECT_I":{"vSIZE":[1,1]}}}}}}],"keywords":["SECT","截面","截面特性"]}
